OL,4,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,5,     GIt's Friday so Huw is out to
OL,6,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,7,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,8,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,9,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,10,G1900FThe People's Party with
OL,11,     FAFRODEUTSCHE
OL,12,     GAn energetic celebration for the
OL,13,     Gend of the working week - a place
OL,14,     Gwhere people come together and
OL,15,     Glet loose, through their shared
OL,16,     Glove of music.
OL,17,G2100F6 Music's Indie Forever
OL,18,     GNothing but solid gold upbeat
OL,19,     Gindie bangers; a throwback to the
OL,20,     Gindie tunes you love with a
OL,21,     Gsprinkling of the finest future
OL,22,     Ghits.
